# Agent worktrees (isolated subagent workspaces) must never be committed
.claude/worktrees/

# Agent definitions and their accumulated notes are per-contributor tooling, not project
# source: they encode how one person's assistant works, and go stale silently because
# nothing builds or tests them. Skills under .claude/skills/ ARE tracked — those encode
# repeatable project procedure.
